+ * arrives as an IRQ (sleh_irq). Sequence verified on hardware by shim-pi5:
+ * GICD_CTLR bit 0, priority 0xA0, GICC_PMR 0xF0, GICC_CTLR bit 0.
+ *
+ * ADT /arm-io/gic "reg" = <GICD base, GICD size, GICC base, GICC size>,
+ * arm-io relative, same shape as the GICv3 node (GICR replaced by GICC).
